# Puck blocks

- Files must match `*.puck.tsx` and export `category` plus `config: ComponentConfig<Props>`.
- Simple block: one file. Interactive picker: `*.edit.puck.tsx` (client) + `*.render.puck.tsx` (server) + `shared.ts`.
- Store IDs in props, not full API objects. Fetch fresh data in render mode.
- Wrap async render trees in `<Suspense>`.
- Never edit `.storefront/puck.*.config.tsx` — `pnpm dev` regenerates them.
- Keep editor fields labeled and give usable `defaultProps`.
